+# Limits of the mouth test (interrupts_wall_line), each swept alone over the six floors. Inside the range given every
+# scored key passage is kept and the detections are the same (the extras listed leave at the other side of it); the
+# values sit in the middle of their range.
+CROSS_PIECE = 0.20      # m: the wall faces may start this far past the far end (a jamb return, a reveal, a thin cross wall).
